    {
      "seq": 5,
      "text": "$c$ slides the wave left or right \\u2014 a phase shift. $d$ lifts the whole wave up or down.",
      "type": "text",
      "emphasis": "normal",
      "reveal_at": 0
    },
    {
      "seq": 6,
      "type": "formula",
      "latex": "\\text{amplitude}=|a|,\\quad \\text{period}=\\tfrac{2\\pi}{|b|},\\quad \\text{shift}=d",
      "emphasis": "normal",
      "reveal_at": 0
    },
    {
      "seq": 7,
      "text": "Range becomes [d − |a|, d + |a|] — the vertical shift moves the whole band.",
