  "part": 2,
  "segments_english": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "text": "One template covers every sine and cosine you'll meet: y equals a sine of b x plus c, all plus d."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "text": "The size of a stretches the wave vertically. That's the amplitude, how tall the peaks are."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "text": "The b squeezes it horizontally. A bigger b packs in more oscillations in the same space, which means a shorter period."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "text": "See it here: compared to plain sine x, the red curve two sine x is twice as tall, and the green curve sine two x oscillates twice as fast."
    },
    {
      "seq": 5,
      "text": "The c slides the wave sideways, a phase shift, and d lifts the whole wave up or down."
    },
    {
      "seq": 6,
      "text": "So amplitude is the size of a, period is two pi over the size of b, and the vertical shift is d."
    },
    {
      "seq": 7,
      "text": "And crucially, the range becomes d minus the size of a, up to d plus the size of a. The shift d moves the entire band, don't forget it."
    }
  ],
  "segments_hinglish": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "text": "एक template हर sine और cosine को cover करता है: y equals a sine of b x plus c, पूरे में plus d."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "text": "a का size wave को vertically stretch करता है. यही amplitude है, peaks कितने ऊँचे."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "text": "b इसे horizontally squeeze करता है. बड़ा b same space में ज़्यादा oscillations भरता है, यानी छोटा period."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "text": "यहाँ देखिए: plain sine x के मुक़ाबले, red curve two sine x दुगुना ऊँचा है, और green curve sine two x दुगनी तेज़ी से oscillate करता है."
    },
    {
      "seq": 5,
      "text": "c wave को sideways slide करता है, phase shift, और d पूरी wave को ऊपर या नीचे उठाता है."
    },
    {
      "seq": 6,
      "text": "So amplitude है a का size, period है two pi over b का size, और vertical shift है d."
    },
    {
      "seq": 7,
      "text": "और ज़रूरी बात, range बनता है d minus a का size, से d plus a का size तक. Shift d पूरी band हिला देता है, इसे मत भूलिए."
    }
  ]
